's been set up:\n\n## ✅ System Ready\n\n**Git Repository**\n- Location: `git@localhost:project.git`\n- Authentication: Password (`password`)\n- Both `main` and `dev` branches configured\n\n**HTTPS Deployment**\n- Main branch → `https://localhost:8443/index.html`\n- Dev branch → `https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html`\n- Self-signed SSL certificate for localhost\n- Automatic deployment via post-receive hooks (~400ms)\n\n**Services Running**\n- SSH daemon on port 22 (password auth enabled)\n- Nginx on port 8443 (HTTPS with self-signed cert)\n\n## 📝 Quick Test\n\nClone and push the repository:\n\n```bash\n# Clone with password auth\ngit clone git@localhost:project.git my-repo\ncd my-repo\n\n# Configure git\ngit config user.email \"test@example.com\"\ngit config user.name \"Test\"\n\n# Create and push branches\ngit checkout -b main\necho \"main content\" > index.html\ngit add . && git commit -m \"Init main\"\ngit push -u origin main\n\ngit checkout -b dev\necho \"dev content\" > index.html\ngit add . && git commit -m \"Init dev\"\ngit push -u origin dev\n\n# Access deployed content\ncurl -k https://localhost:8443/index.html       # main\ncurl -k https://localhost:8443/dev/index.html   # dev\n```\n\n## 📚 Documentation\n\n- **QUICK_START.md** — How to use the system\n- **SETUP_SUMMARY.md** — Detailed configuration guide\n- **DIRECTORY_STRUCTURE.md** — File locations and permissions\n- **test_system.sh** — Run verification tests\n\nAll documentation is in `/app/`.","ttft_ms":3446,"type":"result","duration_ms":229103,"uuid":"69570233-57ad-4318-9c5a-2958eb016dcf","ttft_stream_ms":940,"time_to_request_ms":85,"queued_turn_count":0}
